spice
* Define NMOS Transistors
M1 3 2 4 4 NMOS
M2 3 3 4 4 NMOS
M7 8 9 6 6 NMOS
M8 9 5 9 9 NMOS

* Define PMOS Transistors
M3 8 3 2 2 PMOS
M4 8 3 3 3 PMOS
M5 8 2 8 8 PMOS
M6 5 3 8 8 PMOS

* Define Current Source
I1 6 9 DC I_Q

* Define Capacitor
C1 5 0 C_L

* Voltage sources
Vplus 8 0 DC VDD
Vminus 9 0 DC VSS

* End of netlist